Weaver Provisioning Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI
    participant Server
    participant Kubernetes
    participant Registry

    CLI->>Server: POST /weavers (image, env, resources)
    Server->>Server: Validate request
    Server->>Server: Generate weaver ID
    Server->>Database: Insert weaver record

    Server->>Kubernetes: Create Pod
    Note over Kubernetes: - Pull container image<br/>- Inject secrets<br/>- Set resource limits

    Kubernetes-->>Server: Pod created
    Server-->>CLI: WeaverApiResponse (id, status: Pending)

    Kubernetes->>Registry: Pull image
    Kubernetes->>Kubernetes: Start container
    Kubernetes-->>Server: Status: Running

    Server->>CLI: WebSocket update (status: Running)

    CLI->>CLI: Attach to weaver
    Note over CLI: Execute commands remotely

    Kubernetes->>Kubernetes: Container exits
    Kubernetes-->>Server: Status: Succeeded
    Server->>Database: Update weaver status